<title>NETHERLANDS: EMIS DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>EMIS DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Marketing Information Services NV (EMIS) said on Tuesdau it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 34 held.</p>
<p>In March, the company announced it would pay an unchanged 1996 cash dividend of 0.31 guilders or an alternative stock dividend.</p>
<p>EMIS' shares closed at 11.70 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Tuesday, unchanged from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
